      "passageTitle": "Songmin Health — E-visit instructions",
      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"source-doc\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.05em;line-height:1.73;color:#292723;overflow-wrap:anywhere\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #bcb5aa;padding:17px 19px;margin:5px 0 20px;background:#fff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">Don’t have time to go to your local Songmin clinic for a minor medical issue? E-visits are a convenient way to get help wherever you are. Simply follow these steps:</p><ol style=\"padding-left:25px\"><li>Go to our Web site (www.songminhealth.com) and sign in.</li><li>Hover your mouse over the “E-visits” tab and select “Start an E-visit” from the drop-down menu.</li><li>Answer the questions on the resulting form about your symptoms and concerns. Be as clear and specific as possible. Submit the form.</li><li>Check your e-mail inbox for the response from a Songmin doctor. It may include advice, a referral for testing, or a prescription for medication.</li><li>If you do not receive a response within two business hours, or if there is a change in your symptoms, please call our assistance line at 1-800-555-0138.</li></ol><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\"><strong>SONGMIN HEALTH</strong></p></div></div>",
